Z||000001||Carrolles||09-13-2001||03:20 PM||||The recent FOCOA magazine explained that someone overseas had comadered the Fieroowners.com name and held it hostage.  Phil and Gloria have changed their web address to;<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroownersclub.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroownersclub.com</A>   <P>Their phone number is  (714) 635-0898||||reg||1
Z||000002||FOCOSEVA||09-13-2001||03:21 PM||||Yes, FOCOA still exists. Their telephone number is (714) 635-0898. Of course, they do not man the telephones 24 hours a day, but then again, who does? Their new website is <A HREF="http://www.fieroownersclub.com." TARGET=_blank>www.fieroownersclub.com.</A>  Hope this information helps.<BR>Curry Obenshain <A HREF="http://www.vafieros.com" TARGET=_blank>www.vafieros.com</A> ||||reg||1
